<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose one points to 1,284.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose one points to 1,284.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,284 today from 1,283 on May 16, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1352    12.279	  1356    12.307</p>
<p>   1a   1302  9864.000	  1308  9907.000</p>
<p>   2    1527    21.821	  1522    21.750</p>
<p>   2a   1514 12414.000	  1512 12400.000</p>
<p>   3    1373    12.671	  1372    12.657</p>
<p>   3a   1208  9536.000	  1203  9493.000</p>
<p>   6    1208    12.457	  1208    12.463</p>
